{"id": "1550988405880397855", "channel_id": "1400749543288475770", "author_id": "264894122148495362", "author_name": "sirtealot", "content": "Wanda contributes nothing to the poison teams, she is not exactly a sustain character\nAs far as Liz teams go, you'd want a source of debuffs, Salvador, Thais and Horla work for those purposes \nFor the last slot, any generic support would suffice, ideally Arachne, Caraboo or one of the previous three", "timestamp": "2026-09-19T21:54:11.933000+00:00", "type": 19, "mentions": ["435854475580669962"], "reactions": [{"emoji": "❤️", "emoji_id": null, "count": 1}], "reply_to": "1550986992035176551"}
